ous le plateau inox) et les vis en mode pesée (vis basses).", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 154.4, "w": 29.4, "h": 54.7, "fontSize": 0, "align": "center", "options": [{"label": "OK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 154.4, "w": 29.4, "h": 54.7}}, {"label": "NOK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 392.4, "y": 154.4, "w": 29.7, "h": 54.7}}], "choiceMode": "boxes", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "f7780f57f", "type": "multiline", "label": "1. Commentaire", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 428.1, "y": 154.4, "w": 127.5, "h": 54.7, "fontSize": 8, "align": "left", "options": [], "choiceMode": "text", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "f12fc2e2b", "type": "choice", "label": "2. Vérifier que le Panel PC est correctement installé et fixé. Le Panel PC doit pouvoir être accessible au personnel", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 215.1, "w": 29.4, "h": 32.8, "fontSize": 0, "align": "center", "options": [{"label": "OK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 215.1, "w": 29.4, "h": 32.8}}, {"label": "NOK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 392.4, "y": 215.1, "w": 29.7, "h": 32.8}}], "choiceMode": "boxes", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "f4fbbb396", "type": "multiline", "label": "2. Commentaire", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 428.1, "y": 215.1, "w": 127.5, "h": 32.8, "fontSize": 8, "align": "left", "options": [], "choiceMode": "text", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "f5523a962", "type": "choice", "label": "3. Vérifier l'ensemble du câblage et qu'il n'y a pas de déconnection possible. En particulier, le câble reliant la balance au PPC ne doit pas toucher le plateau de la balance et la prise Jack de l'alimentation de la balance doit être fixée au câble balance-pc à l'aide d'un collier de serrage.", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 253.9, "w": 29.4, "h": 80.9, "fontSize": 0, "align": "center", "options": [{"label": "OK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 253.9, "w": 29.4, "h": 80.9}}, {"label": "NOK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 392.4, "y": 253.9, "w": 29.7, "h": 80.9}}], "choiceMode": "boxes", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "fda6fe994", "type": "multiline", "label": "3. Commentaire", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 428.1, "y": 253.9, "w": 127.5, "h": 80.9, "fontSize": 8, "align": "left", "options": [], "choiceMode": "text", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "fcee1ef6c", "type": "choice", "label": "4. Vérifier que l'accès réseau est correct.", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 340.8, "w": 29.4, "h": 19.7, "fontSize": 0, "align": "center", "options": [{"label": "OK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 340.8, "w": 29.4, "h": 19.7}}, {"label": "NOK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 392.4, "y": 340.8, "w": 29.7, "h": 19.7}}], "choiceMode": "boxes", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "f54a0c6a5", "type": "multiline", "label": "4. Commentaire", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 428.1, "y": 340.8, "w": 127.5, "h": 19.7, "fontSize": 8, "align": "left", "options": [], "choiceMode": "text", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "fbb0c431d", "type": "choice", "label": "5. Vérifier que l'application se lance correctement (tous les indicateurs sont verts).", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 366.5, "w": 29.4, "h": 30.5, "fontSize": 0, "align": "center", "options": [{"label": "OK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 366.5, "w": 29.4, "h": 30.5}}, {"label": "NOK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 392.4, "y": 366.5, "w": 29.7, "h": 30.5}}], "choiceMode": "boxes", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "f45d23e00", "type": "multiline", "label": "5. Commentaire", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 428.1, "y": 366.5, "w": 127.5, "h": 30.5, "fontSize": 8, "align": "left", "options": [], "choiceMode": "text", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "f2a137ef0", "type": "choice", "label": "6. Pour le Drive, vérifier que la touche « même voiture » est bien présente sur l'écran d'accueil de l'application.", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 403.0, "w": 29.4, "h": 45.1, "fontSize": 0, "align": "center", "options": [{"label": "OK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 403.0, "w": 29.4, "h": 45.1}}, {"label": "NOK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 392.4, "y": 403.0, "w": 29.7, "h": 45.1}}], "choiceMode": "boxes", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "f862d2966", "type": "multiline", "label": "6. Commentaire", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 428.1, "y": 403.0, "w": 127.5, "h": 45.1, "fontSize": 8, "align": "left", "options": [], "choiceMode": "text", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "f5be3945c", "type": "choice", "label": "7. Faire une tare de la balance : pour cela, s'assurer que le plateau est bien installé (mettre un poids au niveau des 4 coins).", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 454.1, "w": 29.4, "h": 30.6, "fontSize": 0, "align": "center", "options": [{"label": "OK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 454.1, "w": 29.4, "h": 30.6}}, {"label": "NOK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 392.4, "y": 454.1, "w": 29.7, "h": 30.6}}], "choiceMode": "boxes", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "f267c0180", "type": "multiline", "label": "7. Commentaire", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 428.1, "y": 454.1, "w": 127.5, "h": 30.6, "fontSize": 8, "align": "left", "options": [], "choiceMode": "text", "mark": "x", "lineHeight": 0, "auto": ""}, {"id": "f2d9be941", "type": "choice", "label": "8. Informer le restaurant que le poids sur la balance ne doit pas dépasser 30 kg.", "group": "Check list à vérifier", "page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 490.7, "w": 29.4, "h": 30.5, "fontSize": 0, "align": "center", "options": [{"label": "OK", "box": {"page": 3, "x": 357.0, "y": 490.7, "w": 29.4, "h": 30.5}}